---
description: Astro pages, layouts, components and data loading
globs: apps/web/src/**/*.astro, apps/web/src/**/*.ts, apps/web/astro.config.*
---
- Pin the Astro and @astrojs/vercel versions set in prompt 01. Check the current Astro docs for server islands, sessions, env schema and the Vercel adapter before using them; do not rely on memory of older majors.
- Output: server (on-demand) with ISR for editorial pages; price, stock, bag count and buy box are server islands (`server:defer`) with fallbacks that keep the exact designed size (no layout shift; fidelity tests wait for network idle).
- One component per designed block: `src/components/blocks/<Page>/<BlockId>.astro`. Shared pieces (Header, Footer, Announcement, EditionMeter, PieceCard, Countdown, Button, Chip) in `src/components/ui/`.
- Data access only through `src/lib/sanity/queries.ts` (GROQ, typed results) and `src/lib/commerce/` (provider interface: shopify | fixture | off). Components never call fetch directly.
- Images: Sanity image URLs via @sanity/image-url with the design's sizes, `object-position` from the photo's `position` field (else hotspot), `loading` and `fetchpriority` exactly as in the design snippet, width/height attributes set.
- Routes and query parameters exactly as docs/PAGES.md. Unknown slugs return the 404 page with status 404.
